@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Penulis as User
boundary HalamanEditProfilUI as EditUI
control ProfilController as Controller
entity ProfilProvider as Profil

== Main Flow ==

User -> EditUI : 1: Buka profil sendiri dan klik tombol Edit Profil
activate EditUI
EditUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatDataProfil()
activate Controller
Controller -> Profil : 1.1.1: ambilDataProfil()
activate Profil
Profil --> Controller : 1.1.2: Data profil saat ini
Controller --> EditUI : 1.1.3: Data profil
EditUI --> User : 1.1.4: Tampilkan form edit profil dengan data saat ini

User -> EditUI : 2: Ubah data profil
User -> EditUI : 3: Unggah avatar baru (opsional)
EditUI --> User : 3.1: Tampilkan preview gambar
User -> EditUI : 4: Klik Simpan Perubahan
EditUI -> Controller : 4.1: updateProfil(data)
Controller -> Profil : 4.1.1: perbaruiProfil(data)
Profil --> Controller : 4.1.2: Profil berhasil diperbarui

alt [Update berhasil]
    Controller --> EditUI : 4.1.3: Update berhasil
    EditUI --> User : 4.1.4: Notifikasi sukses
else [Validasi gagal]
    Controller --> EditUI : 4.1.3a: Error validasi
    EditUI --> User : 4.1.4a: Pesan error
end

deactivate Profil
deactivate Controller
deactivate EditUI

@enduml
